	PRINTFORML ＜촉수레벨보정{TENTACLE_RATE}배　에너지{FLAG:촉수에너지}F＞
	PRINTFORML %NAME:ARG,20,LEFT%(ＭＡＧ：%TOSTR(GET_CHARA_STOCK_MAG(ARG), "###,0")%/%TOSTR(GET_CHARA_MAXMAG(ARG), "###,0")%)
